    "detailed_description": "<strong>Own the galaxy</strong><br><strong>You are the protector of your galaxy</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487970/extras/fb09b7ace65d63b84c8ca3740cabd2dc.avif?t=1693621747\" /></span><br><br>In the music galaxy, a prince awaits an attack from outsiders.<br><br>Thousands of spaceships entered the galaxy to mine what does not belong to them! Him is a third person casual game where the player runs and jump between home planets to destroy the invading space pirates and their spaceships under a limited time before they mine the lands.<br><br>You will have the option to choose between different instruments. Each instrument represent a different shooting style for the player. Choose carefully which shooting style you want to play with based on what goals you want to accomplish.",
